 "words": 215,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Gaal son of Ebed came with his brothers",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Moved into Shechem and stayed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The leaders put their trust in him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the shadow of the city gate",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is Abimelech and who is Shechem",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we should serve him as our king",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is he not the son of Jerubbaal",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Zebul as his deputy to bring",
   "heard": 3,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "At the temple of the god of Shechem",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gaal spoke his words of open defiance",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Serve the men of Hamor he said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The father of the city and its alliance",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is Abimelech and who is Shechem",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we should serve him as our king",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is he not the son of Jerubbaal",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.64,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Zebul as his deputy to bring",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zebul heard the words and anger burned",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He sent messengers in the night",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lie in wait in the fields he whispered",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Strike at sunrise with your might",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gaal stood at the gate and saw the troops",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Coming down from the mountaintops",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Zebul mocked his vision of shadows",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Saying you see men where the earth is a stop",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Who is Abimelech and who is Shechem",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.18,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That we should serve him as our king",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Is he not the son of Jerubbaal",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With Zebul as his deputy to bring",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.71,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
